{"id":"wb-3-46","name":"驼山石窟","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"驼山石窟","text":"驼山石窟，位于山东青州的驼山。其有大小石窟五处，佛像638尊，为山东最大的摩崖造像群。其中最早有南北朝时期的北周，还有之后的唐朝，其造像精美，有历史价值。1988年1月3日被国务院列入国家级重点保护文物。驼山石窟造像题材多为西方的三圣像即阿弥陀佛和观世音、大势至菩萨，其次是千佛像、力士像、飞天像及较小的供养人像等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A9%BC%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F","revisionId":88057487,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88057487","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/37956336b8b2fb25191efe6d.jpg","title":"驼山石窟国保.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%A9%BC%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/%E9%A9%BC%E5%B1%B1%E7%9F%B3%E7%AA%9F%E5%9B%BD%E4%BF%9D.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​驼山石窟国家文保单位碑。","width":320,"height":180}}